@clawsweeper re-review

Corrected head: `69f068f43b6421b70f28ce317adf2ceb1601f938`. Both failed CI lanes hit the same pre-existing wrapped-footer assertion for bottom-aligned avatars. The narrow test-only correction asserts the authorized top alignment while retaining footer height, containment, and row adjacency checks; local reproduction and all 111 responsive browser tests pass. Production behavior and all six visual comparisons are unchanged.

The body and preceding reply explicitly record the already-approved maintainer decision to supersede #156340 with inline narration; the work-session link is provenance, not a request for this reviewer to grant new product approval. Independent review found no P0–P2 issue in the correction. Fresh exact-head CI is running.
